  "text": "If there's a mystery of nature that requires firsthand evidence to solve, natural scientists collect that data. They spend months documenting and observing events and creatures in the natural world before returning to their academies, labs, and royal studies.\n\n---\nExplorers are often well-equipped and well-trained for any type of hazard and are eager to lead others into the wild."
